+ * Items regenerate them. There is no control template (ItemsPresenter), grouping or DisplayMemberPath.
+ *
+ * ListView and GridView (ListViewBase, a Selector) are ItemsControls too (kind): each item goes in a container,
+ * a ListViewItem or GridViewItem (listview.c) unless it is one, in an ItemsStackPanel or a horizontal
+ * ItemsWrapGrid, inside a ScrollViewer that scrolls vertically. They keep the selection (SelectionMode,
+ * SelectedIndex / Item / Items, SelectionChanged), raise ItemClick when IsItemClickEnabled, and take the keyboard
